  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital applications study in Agro-Food sector Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this study is to have an updated analysis of the developments and opportunities on the digital transformation in agriculture in Vietnam. This study is part of a broader research exercise for the ASEAN 5 group. A similar study will be conducted for Indonesia (PST22ID03) and there will be a large sector study conducted to get an overview of the Dutch smart agriculture sector.After completion of the studies, the aim is to bring supply and demand together and to promote international trade by sharing the insights of the studies with the business community, government, and relevant civil societies, providing matchmaking between companies, other customers and possibly organizing trade mission.</narrative>
  </description>
